---
---
<section class="py-24 lg:py-32 bg-[#0B0F12]" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 lg:gap-24 items-center">

      <!-- Left: statement -->
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-8">
          <span class="block w-6 h-px bg-[#F97316]"></span>
          <span class="text-xs text-[#F97316] tracking-widest uppercase" style="font-family: var(--font-heading); letter-spacing: 0.18em">About</span>
        </div>
        <h2 id="about-heading" class="text-3xl lg:text-5xl font-700 text-[#F4F5F2] leading-tight mb-8" style="font-family: var(--font-heading)">
          From industrial products<br/>to engineered components.
        </h2>
        <a href="/about/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-[#F97316] border-b border-[#F97316]/40 pb-0.5 hover:border-[#F97316] transition-colors group" style="font-family: var(--font-heading)">
          Know Our Company
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" class="transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1">
            <path d="M2 7h10M8 3l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: body text + image -->
      <div class="reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.1s">
        <div class="relative mb-8">
          <!-- Blueprint SVG background -->
          <svg class="absolute -top-4 -right-4 w-32 h-32 opacity-5 pointer-events-none" viewBox="0 0 128 128" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="1" y="1" width="126" height="126" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="0.5"/>
            <line x1="64" y1="1" x2="64" y2="127" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="0.5"/>
            <line x1="1" y1="64" x2="127" y2="64" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="0.5"/>
            <circle cx="64" cy="64" r="32" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="0.5"/>
            <circle cx="64" cy="64" r="16" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="0.5"/>
          </svg>
          <div class="aspect-[4/3] bg-[#151C21] border border-white/10 overflow-hidden">
            <img
              src="/images/manufacturing/rotary-kiln-1.jpg"
              alt="Industrial manufacturing facility"
              width="800"
              height="600"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-70"
              onerror="this.parentElement.style.background='#1B2328'"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-[#AAB4BA] leading-relaxed text-sm lg:text-base">
          <p>
            We combine industrial product trading with the manufacture of selected components — giving customers access to a broad range of products alongside in-house production capability.
          </p>
          <p>
            Our product range covers welding consumables and machines, cutting tools, material handling equipment, power transmission components, conveyor systems and electrical panels.
          </p>
          <p>
            <em class="text-[#F4F5F2]/60 not-italic text-xs">[Company background and history — placeholder for actual company information]</em>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
